<title>ITALY: TENNIS-ITALY LEAD SPAIN 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-ITALY LEAD SPAIN 2-0 IN DAVIS CUP TIE.</headline>
<dateline>PESARO, Italy 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Italy led Spain 2-0 after</p>
<p>the opening singles matches in their Davis Cup World Group</p>
<p>quarter-final tie on Friday:</p>
<p>Results (Italians first)</p>
<p>Omar Camporese beat Carlos Moya 6-7 (8-10) 6-7 (4-7) 6-1 6-3</p>
<p>6-3</p>
<p>Renzo Furlan beat Alberto Costa 4-6 6-3 4-6 6-4 6-1</p>
</text>
